  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/ThlZWde\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%252fkreatik-studios%252fbiomes-you-go-add--on-(official)%252f2bbcc753-48fe-47c5-a2f2-8f4c0677165e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s4INeOs.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xbn03uM.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zQA4eez2eS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/636017992265891846?color=Yellow&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/247560/description_51a1909d-1a43-43d1-9276-af51fab60d4f.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>\"你头脑中有智慧，脚下有力量。你可以朝着任何你选择的方向前进。</em>&nbsp;<em>你独自一人，深知自己所知。而 YOU 将决定前往何方。”</em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>-苏斯博士，《你去的地方！》</em></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/247560/description_8af90685-7d82-4da6-afc1-255fb4fb75e2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-descent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/247560/description_c9eb9dd5-5b29-4262-b7a3-c26bb03e6622.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wayfinder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/247560/description_0790853e-2f8d-4c10-8c93-32d36d7db0a7.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WJYMi3e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">「Oh The Biomes You'll Go」是一款探索与冒险模组，旨在带你踏上独一无二的 Minecraft 公路旅行！**探索超过 80 个充满魔力、逼真且令人叹为观止的生物群系。**</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXyt5Iv.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
